- **Why it matters**: Deutsche Bank는 stablecoin을 payment rail 관점에서 보고 Bitcoin을 currency가 아니라 crypto asset으로 분리한다. 이 구분은 BTC와 stablecoin issuer economics를 같은 crypto basket으로 묶는 실수를 줄인다.
- **Raw excerpt / abstract**: Money is a unit of account, a medium of exchange and a store value. Stablecoins are classified as a stable means of payment. Bitcoin does not have these attributes and is not really a currency at all, but rather an asset. Bitcoin was central to the rise of stablecoins and created the technological and philosophical conditions that made them possible.
