- **Raw excerpt / abstract**: The paper provides a large-scale empirical audit of DEX routing using 2.98 million WETH-USDC swaps on Ethereum. Comparing realized routes with optimized benchmarks, it measures an average shortfall of 2.02 bps per trade or 24 million dollars. It separates support-constrained optimum, full-venue optimum, and gas-aware full-venue optimum.
