- **Raw excerpt / abstract**: The model estimates a relaxation half-life of approximately 46 years for parameters representative of Ethereum. Passive institutional staking compresses native staking yield and systematically raises nominal token price while shifting consensus ownership away from active utility users. Active speculative capital creates an endogenous constant-value strategy that can shift ownership back toward active utility users after shocks.
