## [07:00 KST] Multicoin Adverse Selection in DeFi: onchain execution은 intent visibility가 비용이다
- **URL**: https://multicoin.capital/2026/02/17/adverse-selection-rules-everything-around-me/
- **Source Type**: blog
- **Domain**: crypto-structure, microstructure, execution
- **Trading Relevance**: 9
- **Time Horizon**: secular
- **Actionability**: study
- **Henry Risk Link**: execution, liquidity
- **Why it matters**: DeFi execution의 핵심 비용은 단순 slippage가 아니라 order intent가 보이는 구조에서 생기는 adverse selection이다. 글은 public mempool, no broker segmentation, CEX-led price discovery, transaction inclusion risk가 market makers에게 모든 flow를 informed로 보이게 만들고 spread를 넓힌다고 설명한다. Henry에게 crypto venue 선택은 fee comparison보다 intent hiding, maker priority, and landing certainty comparison이다.
- **Raw excerpt / abstract**: Market makers treat informed flow as toxic and uninformed flow as desirable. Onchain, retail wallet swaps, institutional programmatic trades, and arbitrage can look similar, while price discovery often starts on CEXs and onchain venues react. During congestion, retail orders may fail to land or trade at stale prices. Proposed mitigations include delaying execution, hiding intent, segmenting flow, dynamic risk pricing, refusing trades in certain conditions, and social coordination.
- **Cold read**: permissionless transparency는 공정해 보이지만, execution에서는 정보 누출 비용을 만든다. 모든 주문이 public이면 uninformed trader도 informed trader 가격을 지불한다.
- **Trading insight**: Henry가 onchain을 쓴다면 public route, private route, limit order, and aggregator를 같은 것으로 보면 안 된다. Landing certainty와 MEV protection은 execution checklist 항목이다.
